@startuml UC3 Bidding Process
title UC3: Bidding Process Sequence Diagram

actor "User\n(Bidder)" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Gateway\nService" as GW
participant "Auction\nService" as AUC
database "Auction DB" as DB
participant "WebSocket\nClients" as WS

User -> FE: View Item Details
activate FE
FE -> GW: GET /api/auction/{itemId}
activate GW
GW -> AUC: getAuctionDetails(itemId)
activate AUC
AUC -> DB: SELECT * FROM auctions\nWHERE itemId=?
activate DB
DB --> AUC: Auction(itemId,\ncurrentPrice,\nhighestBidderId,\nendTime)
deactivate DB
AUC --> GW: AuctionDTO
deactivate AUC
GW --> FE: 200 OK\n(AuctionDetails)
deactivate GW
FE --> User: Display Item\nCurrent Price\nHighest Bidder\nRemaining Time
FE -> WS: Subscribe to WebSocket\n/auction/{itemId}
activate WS

User -> FE: Enter Bid Amount
FE -> GW: POST /api/auction/{itemId}/bid\n{bidAmount, userId}
activate GW
GW -> AUC: validateAndPlaceBid(\nitemId, userId, bidAmount)
activate AUC
AUC -> DB: SELECT currentPrice, endTime\nFROM auctions\nWHERE itemId=?\nFOR UPDATE
activate DB
DB --> AUC: currentPrice, endTime
deactivate DB
AUC -> AUC: validateBid():\n- bidAmount > currentPrice\n- auction not expired
AUC -> DB: UPDATE auctions\nSET currentPrice=bidAmount,\nhighestBidderId=userId\nWHERE itemId=?
activate DB
DB --> AUC: Success
deactivate DB
AUC -> DB: INSERT INTO bid_history\nVALUES(bidId, itemId,\nuserId, bidAmount, timestamp)
activate DB
DB --> AUC: bidId
deactivate DB
AUC --> GW: BidResponse\n(success, newPrice)
deactivate AUC
GW --> FE: 200 OK\n(BidConfirmed)
deactivate GW

AUC -> WS: broadcastBidUpdate(\nitemId, newPrice, bidderId)
WS --> FE: WebSocket BidUpdate Event\n(to all clients)
deactivate WS

FE --> User: Update UI:\n- New Current Price\n- New Highest Bidder\n- Success Message
deactivate FE

note over AUC,DB
When Timer Expires:
- endAuction(itemId)
- UPDATE status='ENDED'
- broadcastAuctionEnded()
end note

@enduml
